{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a charming world that slowly reveals its darker side as you move forward.<br>Face enemies, defeat challenging bosses, copy their abilities,<br>and follow a path that grows ever deeper into the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/extras/f75d4b02ea72ad688ece6373e6fa1331.avif?t=1756837114\" width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <i>Metroidvania-lite</i> with <i>Soulslike</i>-inspired combat,<br>where striking at the right moment is the key to victory \u2014<br>the more anxious you are, the harder the journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/extras/61a1021a24fb4c32b5772d84a18af38e.avif?t=1756837114\" width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loreninha</strong> falls asleep and awakens in a world of vibrant dreams,<br>now being consumed by an ever-growing darkness.<br>But perhaps it\u2019s not just a dream...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993350?t=1756837114","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993350?t=1756837114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/6094abde26187df92bf886269f80dcee8cca4a55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756837114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/6094abde26187df92bf886269f80dcee8cca4a55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756837114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description